[00:00.00][02:21.33]
[00:21.57]Someday everything we know will be gone
[00:31.13]But right now we are here and alive
[00:39.75]And the day where we won't be is far
[00:48.39]So why bother to worry and cry
[00:54.99][01:03.59][01:35.47][01:41.33][02:10.64][02:16.51]We will be alright
[00:57.48][01:06.12][01:37.18][01:43.09][02:12.28][02:18.19]Today
[00:59.24][01:38.42][02:13.55]We can make it right
[01:01.81][01:40.06][02:15.19]Some way
[01:07.99][01:44.28][02:19.37]Things will be okay
[01:10.37][01:45.95] 
[01:13.52]Right after all the noise clears my mind
[01:19.42]The reality facing me shows
[01:25.30]And I cannot believe what I see
[01:31.19]All my conscience sprawled out to decree
[01:48.68]All our voices combine into one
[01:54.54]And our power is more than our sum
[02:00.38]We will conquer our fear and our hate
[02:06.30]And our love can refill and replace
